With this in mind, you are tasked to prove the following target statement.

Target Problem (your task):

\begin{col-thm-precise}[Precise formulation]
The sample complexity of the \textsc{$k$-Colorable} property is 
\[
\mathcal{S}_{k\textsc{-Colorable}}(n,\epsilon) = O\left(\frac{k}{\epsilon} \ln^2\left(\frac{1}{\epsilon}\right)\right).
\]
